---
// TelemetryDials.astro - Consola de 6 Compromisos y Garantías Comerciales para PyMEs (Modo Claro + Modo Oscuro)
---

<section id="garantias" class="relative border-b border-slate-200 bg-white py-20 text-slate-900 transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#060a12] dark:text-[#f8fafc]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header in Technical Manifest Style -->
    <div class="mb-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 gap-4 dark:border-[#1e293b]">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono-tech text-amber-700 mb-2 dark:text-[#d97706]">
          <span>02 / CONSOLA DE COMPROMISOS TÉCNICOS</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-amber-800 border border-amber-300 font-semibold dark:bg-[#d97706]/10 dark:text-[#f59e0b] dark:border-[#d97706]/30">6 PUNTOS CLAVE</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 uppercase tracking-tight font-display dark:text-white">
          Lo Que Garantizamos en Cada Proyecto
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm text-slate-600 font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
          No te pedimos que confíes en promesas de marketing. Estos seis estándares miden exactamente lo que entregamos para que tu negocio crezca en internet sin dolores de cabeza.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono-tech text-xs text-right shadow-xs transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#0b1320] dark:shadow-none">
        <span class="text-slate-500 block text-xs dark:text-[#64748b]">ESTÁNDAR KESSOKU:</span>
        <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold text-sm dark:text-[#10b981]">100% CUMPLIMIENTO VERIFICADO</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Six-Pack Console Grid (2 rows of 3 dials) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-mono-tech">
      
      <!-- Dial 1: Velocidad Móvil -->
      <div data-dial-card class="group relative rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-6 hover:border-blue-700 hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-xs dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#090e1a] dark:hover:border-[#1d4ed8] dark:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3 dark:text-[#64748b]">
          <span>COMPROMISO 01 // VELOCIDAD MÓVIL</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold dark:text-[#10b981]">&lt; 1.0s</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
            <span data-dial-counter="0.85" data-dial-decimals="2" data-dial-suffix="s">0.85s</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium dark:text-[#94a3b8]">CARGA EN CELULARES 4G</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-[#1e293b]">
          <div data-dial-gauge="90%" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-500 dark:from-[#10b981] dark:to-[#34d399]" style="width: 0%;"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
          Tu página carga de inmediato en teléfonos móviles. El 70% de tus clientes abandonan un sitio si tarda más de 3 segundos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dial 2: Adaptabilidad y Google -->
      <div data-dial-card class="group relative rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-6 hover:border-blue-700 hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-xs dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#090e1a] dark:hover:border-[#1d4ed8] dark:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3 dark:text-[#64748b]">
          <span>COMPROMISO 02 // GOOGLE & CELULARES</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold dark:text-[#10b981]">100% RESPONSIVO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
            <span data-dial-counter="100" data-dial-decimals="0" data-dial-suffix="%">100%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium dark:text-[#94a3b8]">DISEÑO MOBILE-FIRST</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-[#1e293b]">
          <div data-dial-gauge="100%" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-400 dark:from-[#10b981] dark:to-[#6ee7b7]" style="width: 0%;"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
          Diseñado primero para celulares y optimizado con SEO técnico para que los clientes locales te encuentren en Google y Google Maps.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dial 3: Conexión WhatsApp Business -->
      <div data-dial-card class="group relative rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-6 hover:border-blue-700 hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-xs dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#090e1a] dark:hover:border-[#1d4ed8] dark:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3 dark:text-[#64748b]">
          <span>COMPROMISO 03 // VENTAS POR WHATSAPP</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold dark:text-[#10b981]">CANAL DIRECTO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
            <span data-dial-counter="1" data-dial-decimals="0" data-dial-suffix=" Clic">1 Clic</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium dark:text-[#94a3b8]">SIN FORMULARIOS LARGOS</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-[#1e293b]">
          <div data-dial-gauge="100%" class="h-full bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-[#10b981]" style="width: 0%;"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
          Botones estratégicos para que el cliente que visita tu web pase a cotizar directamente a tu WhatsApp Business en un solo toque.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dial 4: Tiempo de Entrega -->
      <div data-dial-card class="group relative rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-6 hover:border-amber-600 hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-xs dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#090e1a] dark:hover:border-[#d97706] dark:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3 dark:text-[#64748b]">
          <span>COMPROMISO 04 // ENTREGA RÁPIDA</span>
          <span class="text-amber-700 font-bold dark:text-[#f59e0b]">5 DÍAS HÁBILES</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
            <span data-dial-counter="5" data-dial-decimals="0" data-dial-suffix=" Días">5 Días</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium dark:text-[#94a3b8]">VS 8 SEMANAS OTRAS AGENCIAS</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-[#1e293b]">
          <div data-dial-gauge="95%" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-amber-400 dark:from-[#d97706] dark:to-[#fbbf24]" style="width: 0%;"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
          Estructuración con arquitectura probada. No perdemos semanas en reuniones innecesarias ni te dejamos esperando tu proyecto.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dial 5: Precios Claros sin Sorpresas -->
      <div data-dial-card class="group relative rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-6 hover:border-blue-700 hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-xs dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#090e1a] dark:hover:border-[#1d4ed8] dark:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3 dark:text-[#64748b]">
          <span>COMPROMISO 05 // PRECIOS TRANSPARENTES</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold dark:text-[#10b981]">CERO SORPRESAS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
            <span data-dial-counter="0" data-dial-decimals="2" data-dial-prefix="$">$0.00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium dark:text-[#94a3b8]">COSTOS OCULTOS</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-[#1e293b]">
          <div data-dial-gauge="100%" class="h-full bg-emerald-600 dark:bg-[#10b981]" style="width: 0%;"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
          Sin cobros sorpresa de hosting, certificados SSL ni licencias caras. Lo que cotizamos en el paquete es exactamente lo que pagas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Dial 6: Mantenimiento y Soporte Continuo -->
      <div data-dial-card class="group relative rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/80 p-6 hover:border-blue-700 hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-xs dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#090e1a] dark:hover:border-[#1d4ed8] dark:shadow-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3 dark:text-[#64748b]">
          <span>COMPROMISO 06 // SOPORTE MENSUAL</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold dark:text-[#10b981]">CONTINUO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
            <span data-dial-counter="24" data-dial-decimals="0" data-dial-suffix="/7">24/7</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium dark:text-[#94a3b8]">MONITOREO DE SERVIDOR</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 h-2 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-[#1e293b]">
          <div data-dial-gauge="99.9%" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-sky-500 dark:from-[#10b981] dark:to-[#38bdf8]" style="width: 0%;"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-body dark:text-[#94a3b8]">
          Tu sitio web siempre protegido, respaldado en la nube y con atención directa de los fundadores para cambios menores de contenido.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Live Status Bar -->
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-4 font-mono-tech text-xs text-slate-700 shadow-xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 transition-colors duration-200 dark:border-[#1e293b] dark:bg-[#0b1320] dark:text-[#94a3b8] dark:shadow-none">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 animate-ping dark:bg-[#10b981]"></span>
        <span class="text-slate-950 font-bold dark:text-white">VERIFICACIÓN ACTIVA:</span>
        <span>Cada sitio entregado cumple al 100% con estos seis compromisos de servicio.</span>
      </div>
      <a 
        href="#diagnostico" 
        class="inline-flex items-center text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900 underline underline-offset-4 dark:text-[#93c5fd] dark:hover:text-white"
      >
        ¿Quieres saber cómo califica tu sitio web actual? Solicita diagnóstico gratuito ➔
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
